abstract: "Retrospective constrained initial-condition optimization with TianXing, forward evaluation in Pangu-Weather, and circulation diagnostics for Typhoon Saudel. The repository includes final figure source data and summaries; a companion data archive contains the full initial states and diagnostic forecast sequences. Model weights are external dependencies."
